      "artifacts": [
        {
          "path": "README.md",
          "kind": "markdown",
          "content": "## 日本語\nRepoSeiri は監査結果を根拠付きで提示します。\n\n## Reference data\n```text\nline-01\nline-02\nline-03\nline-04\nline-05\nline-06\nline-07\nline-08\nline-09\nline-10\nline-11\nline-12\nline-13\nline-14\nline-15\nline-16\nline-17\nline-18\nline-19\nline-20\nline-21\nline-22\nline-23\nline-24\nline-25\nline-26\nline-27\nline-28\nline-29\nline-30\nline-31\nline-32\nline-33\nline-34\nline-35\nline-36\nline-37\nline-38\nline-39\nline-40\nline-41\nline-42\nline-43\nline-44\nline-45\nline-46\nline-47\nline-48\nline-49\nline-50\nline-51\nline-52\nline-53\nline-54\nline-55\nline-56\nline-57\nline-58\nline-59\nline-60\nline-61\nline-62\nline-63\nline-64\n```\n\n## English\nRepoSeiri presents audit results with their evidence.\n"
        }
